{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"notFound"},{"type":"text","value":" function returns a new "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NotFoundError"},{"type":"text","value":" object that can be either returned or thrown from places like a Route's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"beforeLoad"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"loader"},{"type":"text","value":" callbacks to trigger the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"notFoundComponent"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"notfound-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"notFound options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"notFound"},{"type":"text","value":" function accepts a single optional argument, the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" to create the not-found error object."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./NotFoundErrorType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial<NotFoundError>"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"notfound-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"notFound returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"throw"},{"type":"text","value":" property is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" in the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object, the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NotFoundError"},{"type":"text","value":" object will be thrown from within the function call."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"throw"},{"type":"text","value":" property is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false | undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" in the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object, the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NotFoundError"},{"type":"text","value":" object will be returned."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { notFound, createFileRoute, rootRouteId } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst Route = new createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  // throwing a not-found object\n  loader: ({ context: { post } }) => {\n    if (!post) {\n      throw notFound()\n    }\n  },\n  // or if you want to show a not-found on the whole page\n  loader: ({ context: { team } }) => {\n    if (!team) {\n      throw notFound({ routeId: rootRouteId })\n    }\n  },\n  // ... other route options\n})","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"notfound-options","text":"notFound options","level":2},{"id":"notfound-returns","text":"notFound returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `notFound` function returns a new `NotFoundError` object that can be either returned or thrown from places like a Route's `beforeLoad` or `loader` callbacks to trigger the `notFoundComponent`.\n\n## notFound options\n\nThe `notFound` function accepts a single optional argument, the `options` to create the not-found error object.\n\n- Type: [`Partial<NotFoundError>`](./NotFoundErrorType.md)\n- Optional\n\n## notFound returns\n\n- If the `throw` property is `true` in the `options` object, the `NotFoundError` object will be thrown from within the function call.\n- If the `throw` property is `false | undefined` in the `options` object, the `NotFoundError` object will be returned.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { notFound, createFileRoute, rootRouteId } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst Route = new createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  // throwing a not-found object\n  loader: ({ context: { post } }) => {\n    if (!post) {\n      throw notFound()\n    }\n  },\n  // or if you want to show a not-found on the whole page\n  loader: ({ context: { team } }) => {\n    if (!team) {\n      throw notFound({ routeId: rootRouteId })\n    }\n  },\n  // ... other route options\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: notFoundFunction\ntitle: notFound function\n---\n\nThe `notFound` function returns a new `NotFoundError` object that can be either returned or thrown from places like a Route's `beforeLoad` or `loader` callbacks to trigger the `notFoundComponent`.\n\n## notFound options\n\nThe `notFound` function accepts a single optional argument, the `options` to create the not-found error object.\n\n- Type: [`Partial<NotFoundError>`](./NotFoundErrorType.md)\n- Optional\n\n## notFound returns\n\n- If the `throw` property is `true` in the `options` object, the `NotFoundError` object will be thrown from within the function call.\n- If the `throw` property is `false | undefined` in the `options` object, the `NotFoundError` object will be returned.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { notFound, createFileRoute, rootRouteId } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst Route = new createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  // throwing a not-found object\n  loader: ({ context: { post } }) => {\n    if (!post) {\n      throw notFound()\n    }\n  },\n  // or if you want to show a not-found on the whole page\n  loader: ({ context: { team } }) => {\n    if (!team) {\n      throw notFound({ routeId: rootRouteId })\n    }\n  },\n  // ... other route options\n})\n```\n"}
